* December 12th - '''100 Thieves''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with the signing of the former [[Immortals]] lineup. <ref name="100Thieves sign ex-Immortals">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/940780971485306880|title=We're proud to announce that 100 Thieves is officially entering into Counter-Strike: Global Offensive!|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2017-12-12}}</ref> Additionally, [[bLecker]] is signed as a coach and manager. <ref name="blecker joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/rblecker/status/940881810157862914|title=Somos 100thieves !!! Essa foi nossa primeira foto juntos e espero ter muitas outras com essa…|trans_title=We are 100thieves! This was our first picture together and I hope to have many more|language={{Flag|ptbr}} Portuguese|author=[[bLecker]]|date=2017-12-13}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 25th - '''100 Thieves''' release [[kNgV-]] due to "offensive and inappropriate language" used in a Twitter argument with esports journalist Duncan "[[Thorin]]" Shields. <ref name="kNg kicked">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/956612260700471297|title=An important message from all of us here at 100 Thieves|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2018-01-25}}</ref>
* January 31st - '''100 Thieves''' release the rest of the lineup and withdraw from ''Global Offensive''. <ref name="Our future in Counter-Strike: Global Offensive">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/958792360929869824|title=Our future in Counter-Strike: Global Offensive|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2018-01-31}}</ref>

|content3=
* October 31st - '''100 Thieves''' announce their re-entry into ''Global Offensive'' with the acquisition of the [[Renegades]] roster. <ref name="RNG roster to 100T">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1189985320982335488|title=Announcing 100 Thieves CS:GO|date=2019-10-31|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* April 28th - '''100 Thieves''' part ways with [[kassad]]. <ref name="kassad leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100ThievesLive/status/1255134795505393664|title=After extensive discussions, we’ve mutually agreed to part ways with our CS:GO Head Coach, Kassad.|date=2020-04-28|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
* May 26th - '''100 Thieves''' sign [[Chet]] as their new coach. <ref name="ImAPet signed">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1265327545341243392|title=Welcome @ImAPet1 as our new CS:GO Head Coach!|date=2020-05-26|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
* September 28th - [[Chet]] announces his retirement from professional ''CS:GO'' coaching and parts ways with '''100 Thieves'''. <ref name="chet retires">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/chetsingh/status/1310680026535395329?s=20|title=Today I retire from competitive CS:GO|date=2020-09-28|author=[[Chet]]}}</ref>
* October 18th - '''100 Thieves''' transfer list their roster and announce their departure from the ''Global Offensive'' scene. <ref name="100T release 2020 roster 1">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1315710200846798848|title=It is with a heavy heart we announce that 100 Thieves will be exiting CS:GO|date=2020-10-12|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref><ref name="100T release 2020 roster 2">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1317970477550235649|title=You fought hard|date=2020-10-18|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
* October 19th - [[jkaem]] is acquired by [[Apeks]]. <ref name="jkaem to Apeks">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/apeksgg/status/1318130964468563968|title=We are very happy to announce our fifth player in the CS:GO-roster. Say hello to @jkaem!|date=2020-10-19|author=[[Apeks]]}}</ref>
* October 23rd - [[jks]] is acquired by [[Complexity Gaming]]. <ref name="col jks">{{cite web|url=https://complexity.gg/complexity-welcomes-jks-to-col-cs/|title=Complexity Welcomes jks to COL.CS|date=2020-10-23|author=Andrew Miesner|publisher=[[Complexity Gaming]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 24th - [[AZR]], [[Gratisfaction]], and [[Liazz]] are acquired by [[EXTREMUM]]. <ref name="trio leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/extremumgg/status/1353326850659913728|title=We are ready to show you another way – #OURWAY|date=2021-01-24|author=[[EXTREMUM]]}}</ref>

|content6=
*November 12th - '''100 Thieves''' announce their entry into [[Counter-Strike 2]] by appointing [[sgares]] and [[messioso]] as Head of FPS and Head of CS Operations, respectively. <ref name="100T return">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/1988668309966057903|title=The pieces are ready to fall|date=2025-11-12|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
*November 13th - '''100 Thieves''' sign [[rain]]. <ref name="+rain">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/1989030639346282667|title=Long live the King|date=2025-11-13|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
*December 19th - '''100 Thieves''' sign [[gla1ve]] as the team's coach. <ref name="+gla1ve">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/2002084157191827539|title=Target found|date=2025-12-19|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>

|content7=
*January 5th - '''100 Thieves''' acquire [[poiii]], [[sirah]], and [[Ag1l]] from [[Alliance]], [[ECSTATIC]], and [[SAW]], respectively. <ref name="+poiii">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/2008237458060882379|title=Future of Sweden|date=2026-01-05|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref><ref name="+sirah">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/2008244824802296007|title=Beating the Unction Allegations|date=2026-01-05|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref><ref name="+Ag1l">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/2008259260476780824|title=Adding a little bit of spice to the Nordic Squad|date=2026-01-05|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
*January 6th - '''100 Thieves''' acquire [[dev1ce]] from [[Astralis]] to complete their roster. <ref name="+dev1ce">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/2008599620931420556|title=The King of Danish Counter Strike|date=2026-01-06|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
* January 22nd - '''100 Thieves''' sign [[Zander (Portuguese player)|zander]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+zander">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/zanderwer1/status/2014414145668407449|title=Joined @100T_CS as Assistant Coach.|date=2026-01-22|author=[[Zander (Portuguese player)|zander]]}}</ref>
* June 29th - '''100 Thieves''' bench [[Ag1l]]. <ref name="ag1l bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/2071624787881763074|title=We have made the decision to move @ag1LLL to our reserves moving forward as we rebuild our core structure|date=2026-06-29|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
* July 1st - '''100 Thieves''' acquire [[Gizmy]] from [[Monte]]. <ref name="+Gizmy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_CS/status/2072351302693147120|title=It's Coming Home|date=2026-07-01|author='''100 Thieves'''}}</ref>
* July 16th - '''100 Thieves''' release [[Ag1l]]. <ref name="-ag1l">{{inside source|source=Ag1l}}</ref>
}}

